Aditya Birla – Corporate Website

This project is a frontend recreation of the Aditya Birla Group website, designed to showcase the organization's businesses, achievements, initiatives, and overall digital presence.

The website focuses on a modern, clean, and visually engaging user interface, with carefully structured sections, navigation, images, and responsive styling.

Key Features
Modern corporate-style landing page
Responsive navigation bar
Multiple content sections
Image-based visual presentation
Dedicated Performance Space section
Organized assets and media
Responsive layout using HTML & CSS
Hosted using GitHub Pages
Technologies Used
HTML5 – Structure and content
CSS3 – Styling, layout, animations, and responsiveness
Git & GitHub – Version control and deployment
GitHub Pages – Website hosting
